Psalm 134

1 O cóme, bléss the LÓRD,
áll you sérvants of the LÓRD,
who stánd by níght in the cóurts
of the hóuse of the LÓRD.
2 Lift up your hánds to the hóly pláce,
and bléss the LÓRD.

3 May the LÓRD bléss you from Síon,
he who máde both héaven and éarth.

Glóry to the Fáther, and to the Són,
and to the Hóly Spírit:
as it wás in the begínning, is nów,
and will be for éver. Amén.
